flowchart TD
    start([Incoming lead request]) --> log_request[Write webhook event with raw payload]
    log_request --> authorized{Bearer token valid?}
    authorized -- No --> unauthorized[Set outcome to unauthorized]
    unauthorized --> response_401([Return 401])
    authorized -- Yes --> valid_payload{Payload valid?}
    valid_payload -- No --> invalid[Set outcome to invalid and record validation errors]
    invalid --> response_400([Return 400])
    valid_payload -- Yes --> normalize[Normalize phone and email]
    normalize --> lock_ids[Lock supplied lead ID, phone, and email keys in sorted order]
    lock_ids --> duplicate{Match in queue or assigned lead contacts?}

    duplicate -- Yes --> resolve_duplicate[Apply duplicate rule; attach unclaimed identifiers]
    resolve_duplicate --> identity_conflict{Phone and email match different leads?}
    identity_conflict -- Yes --> conflict_log[Keep older lead; record conflicting IDs]
    identity_conflict -- No --> duplicate_log[Set webhook outcome to duplicate]
    conflict_log --> duplicate_log
    duplicate_log --> response_200([Return 200 with existing lead ID])

    duplicate -- No --> enqueue[Insert lead into lead_queue]
    enqueue --> worker[Assignment worker claims oldest eligible row]
    worker --> lock_state[Lock assignment_state]
    lock_state --> agent_available{Any online agent?}
    agent_available -- No --> remain_queued[Keep lead queued; no failure recorded]
    remain_queued --> accepted_queued[Set webhook outcome to accepted]
    accepted_queued --> response_202([Return 202 queued])
    remain_queued -. Agent comes online or periodic sweep .-> worker

    agent_available -- Yes --> choose_agent[Choose next online agent by round-robin order]
    choose_agent --> auto_commit[Atomic transaction: create lead and contacts, initial status, assignment event, notification; advance pointer; remove queue row]
    auto_commit --> accepted_assigned[Set webhook outcome to accepted]
    accepted_assigned --> response_201([Return 201 with assigned agent])

    auto_commit -. Transaction fails and rolls back .-> record_failure[Record failed attempt, error, and backoff time]
    record_failure --> retry_limit{Five failed attempts reached?}
    retry_limit -- No --> retry_wait[Keep queued until backoff expires]
    retry_wait --> worker
    retry_limit -- Yes --> parked[Set parked_at; show as needing attention]
    parked -. Periodic sweep retries when eligible .-> worker

    subgraph operator_override[Manual assignment and reassignment - proposed]
        board_action[Operator selects queued lead or existing lead] --> target_online{Selected agent online?}
        target_online -- No --> reject_manual[Reject without changing lead or queue]
        target_online -- Yes --> lock_target[Lock target row, then assignment_state]
        lock_target --> assignment_kind{Queued lead or existing lead?}
        assignment_kind -- Queued --> manual_assign[Create lead, contacts, initial status, manual event; remove queue row]
        assignment_kind -- Existing --> reassign[Update current owner; append reassigned event; preserve status and notes]
        manual_assign --> manual_commit[In same transaction, notify recipient and advance sequence and pointer]
        reassign --> manual_commit
        manual_commit --> manual_result([Show successful assignment in live feed])
    end